<div n="5"><head>48. <hi rendition="#g">Der Reval&#x017F;che Birnapfel</hi>. Fig. 48.</head><lb/>
<p>Was zuvor vom Zikadiren des A&#x017F;trakani&#x017F;chen Apfels<lb/>
