<div n="5"><head>228. <hi rendition="#g">Der gelbe Herb&#x017F;t</hi>-<hi rendition="#g">Zuckerapfel</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">P</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">sucré<lb/>
