<div n="4"><head><hi rendition="#aq">VI</hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Cla&#x017F;&#x017F;e</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">I</hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Ordnung</hi>.<lb/>
